# 1Password references for the enricher's LLM calls. Recreate with:
#   op run --env-file=.env.op -- docker compose up -d --no-deps enricher
# op resolves them in memory; never render them into a file on disk.
# Both enricher LLM calls (slop gate + session summary) target the
# AutomaticAI gateway with the enricher's own consumer token (the
# "enricher" field on the AutomaticAI Gateway Tokens item). Per-call
# JEV_API_KEY/SUMMARY_API_KEY overrides take precedence when set, so leave
# them unset unless a call needs a different gateway token.
OPENAI_COMPAT_API_KEY=op://DeLoSecrets/yeurk5dpqkaarspvsn3cjtmkki/enricher
